TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 10 in 100
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -kinetic_reactants Albite
END
